# Blacksmith's Talent. At level 1 (CR 716.2a) its beginning-of-combat ability does not exist yet: at Bot1's beginning of combat on turn 1
# nothing triggers, so Bot1 is not asked for targets, and the Sword and the creature stay as they were. Bot1 holds priority in the step
# (a mana ability, which does not use the stack) so the stack is read once any trigger would have been put on it.

